WEBVTT

00:10:29.236 --> 00:10:30.476
In the Buddhist tradition,

00:10:30.516 --> 00:10:36.756
we know that our intention,
our deepest aspiration,

00:10:36.796 --> 00:10:40.356
is an immense source of energy.

00:10:41.356 --> 00:10:45.436
Which brings us to question number three.

00:10:47.596 --> 00:10:48.956
What do you want?

00:10:51.356 --> 00:10:54.796
What do you really want?

00:10:56.956 --> 00:11:00.036
What is most important to you?